{"4045190":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"饲养染的30 DAYS","steam_appid":4045190,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story, a wish<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems just ordinary<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fulfilling a wish always comes with a price<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet we enjoy dreaming dreams that we don't want to awaken from in our daily lives<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this time'I' hope to bring 'you' home<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel [饲养染的30DAYS] will bring an ordinary story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4045190\/extras\/a6b49f274f2e993cf8718450f5575cc8.avif?t=1790212402\" width=1024 height=478 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your play and valuable feedback.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Game Introduction』<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, tormented by illness, you encounter her in an alley.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She says her name is RaN, and she wants to spend a few days in your home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason, you agree to her request.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know that 30 days is long for her, yet also very short.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you wish this was just a dream.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you wish this was something truly real.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is real? What is fake?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it really... matter?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you really have to make a &quot;choice&quot;?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Character』<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4045190\/extras\/7b2057c1045b6b401919a5a826bc7263.avif?t=1790212402\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4045190\/extras_big\/7b2057c1045b6b401919a5a826bc7263.avif?t=1790212402 width=1560 height=1560 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >染 RaN<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preferences: Milk<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dislikes: Bright lights, Canned fish<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;How are you?&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed from a kitten into a human<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The peculiarities about her go unnoticed by othersShe seems to know everything about you; <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she always hopes you can live a more normal life<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 days is a long time for her<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has waited for you for too long...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4045190\/extras\/4f8d6395b679fac5221cb150ad8056e5.avif?t=1790212402\" width=1280 height=1280 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >塔斯 TARS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A companion who calls themselves 'pointer'<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only appears after DAY 20<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will bring you more chances to rewrite the ending<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Have you really forgotten me?』<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Even RaN have forgotten me??』<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staff List:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Art\/UI Artist: 赤橙chio<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Actor CV (RaN\/TARS): 恪诀<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copywriting\/Programming: XiAoRaN_Channel<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public Assets CC0\/CC-BY:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >甘茶の音楽工房(Music)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >みんちりえ (Backgrounds)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >永远的空之女王 (Bubble UI)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renpy Official Demo (Paper UI)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >花间莉萝 (Code Reference)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincere thanks to all the creators ww<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few notes:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an independent game, there are still many shortcomings in this visual novel, and the sparse CG images and illustrations will be followed up later.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an independent game, this game follows the CC0\/CC-BY license, and the sources of the materials have been credited within the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the character illustrator ChiOrange and the Bilibili uploader HuanJianLiLuo, as well as Ren'Py tutorials from the forever Queen of the Sky.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks also to all members who participated in the game testing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing this work.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Sincerely,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XiAoRaN<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story, a wish<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems just ordinary<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fulfilling a wish always comes with a price<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet we enjoy dreaming dreams that we don't want to awaken from in our daily lives<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this time'I' hope to bring 'you' home<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel [饲养染的30DAYS] will bring an ordinary story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4045190\/extras\/a6b49f274f2e993cf8718450f5575cc8